                        "glosses": [
                            "Slothfulness, laziness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary",
                            "rare",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f6f77c4-aa41-4278-8405-a590e4368f56",
                                "sense_id": "82335ad0-3c1d-38a6-b816-234d116a15ea",
                                "text": "Pigritude. Slothfulnes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0eb9903b-69c9-45fa-9c29-b0898ec1baee",
                                "sense_id": "82335ad0-3c1d-38a6-b816-234d116a15ea",
                                "text": "But, with a little thoughtful frequenting, those deserted river-sides become contemplative and pleasant rambling-places, and, if some whim of fashion do not make the bank of the Hudson like the Marina of Smyrna, a fashionable resort, I have my Sunday afternoons provided for, during the pigritude of city durance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00ceb600-01c7-4081-8dde-d6af54c4cb56",
                                "sense_id": "82335ad0-3c1d-38a6-b816-234d116a15ea",
                                "text": "If people have sunk into such shameful pigritude that they will only fight if wantonly attacked, is it moral to twist facts in such a way as to make the enemy appear to bear all the blame?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4e3f32c-8eae-4a5f-a172-6b97b70accec",
                                "sense_id": "82335ad0-3c1d-38a6-b816-234d116a15ea",
                                "text": "Yes, I was guilty of procrastination, sloth, accidie, pigritude (a lovely old word for laziness), stupidity perhaps, but did I not try?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
